<title>USA: Dignity Partners sell policies.</title>
<headline>Dignity Partners sell policies.</headline>
<dateline>SAN FRANCISCO 1996-10-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Dignity Partners Inc said Wednesday it has reached an agreement with a viatical settlement company to sell 197 policies with an aggregate face value of $14.2 million for $8.7 million.</p>
<p>The policies to be sold insure the lives of individuals with HIV or AIDS. The company also said it intends to seek stockholder approval to sell all or substantially all of its assets, including those in the announced sale.</p>
</text>
